       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CONSIGNAR-DINERO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 SALDO-INICIAL     USAGE COMP-2.
       01 MONTO-CONSIGNAR   USAGE COMP-2.
       01 SALDO-ACTUALIZADO USAGE COMP-2.
       01 ESTADO            PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING SALDO-INICIAL
                                MONTO-CONSIGNAR
                                SALDO-ACTUALIZADO
                                ESTADO.
       MAIN-PROCEDURE.
           COMPUTE SALDO-ACTUALIZADO = SALDO-INICIAL + MONTO-CONSIGNAR
           MOVE 0 TO ESTADO
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM CONSIGNAR-DINERO.